# Step 6 - Contracts MVP (branch step-6-contracts). Acceptance file.
#
# How these results were produced (read this before trusting a PASS):
# - The requests below were NOT sent through this file in an HTTP client. Each case was
#   executed as an equivalent request by the PowerShell driver
#   docs/tests/scripts/s6_contracts.ps1 against the running app
#   (http://localhost:5181, Development, database NEBRASDB_Step1). Method, path, body and
#   expected status are the same; the driver is the evidence. The driver starts the app once
#   with RateLimit__AuthPerMinute=1000.
# - Identity is taken from the JWT only (ICurrentUser). Routes/bodies carry NO actor ids and
#   no server-controlled fields (status/timestamps/ids).
# - Status mapping (Enums/ContractStatus.cs): 1 PendingSignatures, 2 Active, 3 Terminated,
#   4 Rejected.
# - Result legend, on the line under each case title:
#   PASS     executed by the driver; the actual status/DB value matched the expectation
#   FAIL     executed; the actual value did not match
#   BLOCKED  not executed (none in Step 6; privileged credentials were available)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5181
@landlordToken = <capture-locally-do-not-commit>
@landlordBToken = <capture-locally-do-not-commit>
@investor1Token = <capture-locally-do-not-commit>
@investor2Token = <capture-locally-do-not-commit>
@adminToken = <capture-locally-do-not-commit>
@acceptedOfferId = <accepted-offer-id>
@pendingOfferId = <non-accepted-offer-id>
@contractId = <contract-id>
@nonSignedContractId = <contract-id>

# ================= Creation =================

### Anonymous create contract - EXPECTED: 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "offerId": {{acceptedOfferId}} }

### Landlord create contract - EXPECTED: 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "offerId": {{acceptedOfferId}} }

### Investor create contract - EXPECTED: 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{investor1Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "offerId": {{acceptedOfferId}} }

### Unknown offer - EXPECTED: 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "offerId": 2147480000 }

### Offer not Accepted - EXPECTED: 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "offerId": {{pendingOfferId}} }

### Valid accepted offer - EXPECTED: 201 (status PendingSignatures; criterion = land.VerifiedAgainstCriterionId; offerVersion = offer.AcceptedVersionId; reservation.ContractId set; offer Closed with ClosedByContract history)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "offerId": {{acceptedOfferId}} }

### Duplicate contract for the same offer - EXPECTED: 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "offerId": {{acceptedOfferId}} }

### Extra JSON properties must not set server-controlled fields - EXPECTED: 201, status stays PendingSignatures, id is server-generated
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "offerId": {{pendingOfferId}}, "id": 12345, "status": "Active", "investorId": 999 }

# ================= Signing =================

### Non-party sign - EXPECTED: 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{investor2Token}}

### Admin sign - EXPECTED: 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Investor signs once - EXPECTED: 200 (investorSignedAt set)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{investor1Token}}

### Repeated investor signature - EXPECTED: 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{investor1Token}}

### Landlord signs once - EXPECTED: 200 (landlordSignedAt set)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

# ================= Review =================

### Review before both parties signed - EXPECTED: 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{nonSignedContractId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "approve": true }

### Landlord review - EXPECTED: 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "approve": true }

### Successful approval - EXPECTED: 200 (status Active; Approved review row; adminReviewedAt set; no new reservation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "approve": true }

### Repeated review - EXPECTED: 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "approve": true }

### Reviews readable by admin - EXPECTED: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# ================= Rejection =================

### Reject without reason - EXPECTED: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "approve": false }

### Reject with reason - EXPECTED: 200 (status Rejected; reservation released; land Verified + history; a new offer is then allowed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "approve": false, "reason": "Terms not acceptable" }

# ================= Termination =================

### Landlord terminate - EXPECTED: 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}/terminate
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Project cancelled" }

### Terminate a non-Active contract - EXPECTED: 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{nonSignedContractId}}/terminate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Project cancelled" }

### Terminate without reason - EXPECTED: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}/terminate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "" }

### Terminate an Active contract - EXPECTED: 200 (status Terminated; reservation released; land Verified + history)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}/terminate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Project cancelled" }

### Sign a non-PendingSignatures contract - EXPECTED: 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{investor1Token}}

# ================= Visibility & validation =================

### Third-party read an existing contract - EXPECTED: 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{investor2Token}}

### Third-party read reviews - EXPECTED: 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{investor2Token}}

### Missing contract - EXPECTED: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/2147480000
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Other landlord lists only their own contracts - EXPECTED: 200, empty
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordBToken}}

### Admin lists all contracts - EXPECTED: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Invalid status - EXPECTED: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts?status=Bogus
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### pageSize above the maximum - EXPECTED: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts?pageSize=1000
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Valid status filter - EXPECTED: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts?status=Active
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# ================= Criteria compatibility =================

### Admin adds a stricter criterion - EXPECTED: 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/criteria
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "minAreaDonum": 20, "maxSlopePct": 8, "maxGridDistanceKm": 15, "minSolarIrradiance": 5, "minElevationM": null, "reason": "S6 stricter criterion" }

### Review a contract whose land was verified under the older criterion - EXPECTED: 200 (Active; no re-verification during review)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{nonSignedContractId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "approve": true }
